## Is More Analysis Needed?

Yes. Quantitative metrics alone cannot explain **why** content works, so interviews add the reasons.

- Focus groups with hospitality undergraduates
- One-on-one interviews with CMAA leaders and alumni
- Goal: find what builds belonging, and surface challenges in the program (Anthony et al., 2023)

